Common Type AcademicHonor
    documentation 'Academic distinctions earned by or awarded to the student.
    include Achievement
        documentation 'NEEDS DOCUMENTATION
        is required
    enumeration AcademicHonorCategory
        documentation 'A designation of the type of academic distinctions earned by or awarded to the 
        'student.
        is part of identity
    string HonorDescription
        documentation 'A description of the type of academic distinctions earned by or awarded to the 
        'individual.
        is optional
        min length 1
        max length 80
    date HonorAwardDate
        documentation 'The date the honor was awarded or earned.
        is optional
    date HonorAwardExpiresDate
        documentation 'Date on which the award expires.
        is optional
